// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
//
// Two hashes are carried at once as 64 bit planes s[8 * row + bit], bit
// position 2 * column + hash. The S-box is the Boyar-Peralta AES circuit and
// MixBytes a shared-term XOR network, both written out mechanically as 3-input
// logic over 32-bit words. src/core/groestl512.c is the scalar reference.

